                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="academic-quote-box h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center m-0">
                    <p class="academic-quote-text" data-i18n-en="&ldquo;An academic institution is defined not merely by the students within its lecture halls, but by the enduring contributions of those who carry its principles into the world.&rdquo;" data-i18n-tr="&ldquo;Bir akademik kurum, yalnızca amfilerindeki öğrencilerle değil; ilkelerini dünyaya taşıyan mezunlarının kalıcı katkılarıyla tanımlanır.&rdquo;">
                        &ldquo;An academic institution is defined not merely by the students within its lecture halls, but by the enduring contributions of those who carry its principles into the world.&rdquo;
                    </p>
                    <div class="academic-quote-author" data-i18n-en="Institutional Convocation Address" data-i18n-tr="Kurumsal Mezuniyet Hitabı">
                        Institutional Convocation Address
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
