                        Participate in our university's official alumni network to reconnect with faculty peers, mentor graduating scholars, and discover academic and career initiatives.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 text-lg-end">
                    <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row flex-lg-column gap-3 justify-content-lg-end">
                        <a href="/User" class="btn-academic-gold" data-i18n-en="Explore the Alumni Directory" data-i18n-tr="Mezunlar Dizinini Keşfet">
                            Explore the Alumni Directory
                        </a>
                        <a href="/JobPosting" class="btn-academic-outline" data-i18n-en="Discover Career Opportunities" data-i18n-tr="Kariyer Fırsatlarını İncele">
                            Discover Career Opportunities
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
